{"id":"ea846f0a3813bc0e","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-pdbf.md","title":"Partially defined Boolean functions","display":"df-pdbf — Partially defined Boolean functions","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-pdbf","aliases":["27-df-pdbf"],"display":"df-pdbf — Partially defined Boolean functions","depends_on":["[[27-df-bool]]","[[27-df-vardom]]"],"local_review_status":"2026-10-20-formalization-reviewed-source-text-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-pdbf"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-pdbf</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pdbf — Partially defined Boolean functions"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1da79f596b2671f9\" href=\"?note=1da79f596b2671f9\" title=\"27-df-bool\">27-df-bool</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4b84ee77aaf0c828\" href=\"?note=4b84ee77aaf0c828\" title=\"27-df-vardom\">27-df-vardom</a></span></div>"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"2026-10-20-formalization-reviewed-source-text-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B\">\\(\\mathbb B\\)</span> (Boolean domain, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1da79f596b2671f9\" href=\"?note=1da79f596b2671f9\" title=\"27-df-bool\">27-df-bool</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B^n=\\mathbb B^{[n]}\">\\(\\mathbb B^n=\\mathbb B^{[n]}\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4b84ee77aaf0c828\" href=\"?note=4b84ee77aaf0c828\" title=\"27-df-vardom\">27-df-vardom</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{pdBf}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{pdBf}_n\\)</span>（本目录的无冲突相容样本对子类，定义目标）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{pdBf}_n\\coloneqq\\{(T,F)\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb B^n)\\times\\mathcal P(\\mathbb B^n)\\mid T\\cap F=\\emptyset\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{pdBf}_n\\coloneqq\\{(T,F)\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb B^n)\\times\\mathcal P(\\mathbb B^n)\\mid T\\cap F=\\emptyset\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 §12.1、§12.2.1（印刷 pp.511,514／PDF pp.535,538）将任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n\">\\(T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n\\)</span> 组成的样本对称为 pdBf，未在这一称呼中要求两标签集不交；Theorem 12.1（印刷 p.515／PDF p.539）再给出扩张存在当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\cap F=\\emptyset\">\\(T\\cap F=\\emptyset\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>本目录的符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{pdBf}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{pdBf}_n\\)</span> 专指其中无冲突的相容子类，这是显式的本地约定，不能把它误读为原书任意样本对的完整载体。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 分别规定真点和假点，其余点未定。冲突样本仍可输入 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2080bf803b294b75\" href=\"?note=2080bf803b294b75\" title=\"27-df-extension\">27-df-extension</a> 已定义的任意样本对接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ext}_n(T,F)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ext}_n(T,F)\\)</span>；相交时该集合为空。这里不以扩张接口作为本定义的构造前提。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-bool","status":"resolved","id":"1da79f596b2671f9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-bool]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-vardom","status":"resolved","id":"4b84ee77aaf0c828","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-vardom]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-bool","status":"resolved","id":"1da79f596b2671f9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbb B$ (Boolean domain, see [[27-df-bool]])","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-vardom","status":"resolved","id":"4b84ee77aaf0c828","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\mathbb B^n=\\mathbb B^{[n]}$，见 [[27-df-vardom]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-extension","status":"resolved","id":"2080bf803b294b75","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"本目录的符号 $\\mathrm{pdBf}_n$ 专指其中无冲突的相容子类，这是显式的本地约定，不能把它误读为原书任意样本对的完整载体。$T$、$F$ 分别规定真点和假点，其余点未定。冲突样本仍可输入 [[27-df-extension]] 已定义的任意样本对接口 $\\mathrm{Ext}_n(T,F)$；相交时该集合为空。这里不以扩张接口作为本定义的构造前提。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb B","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb B^n=\\mathbb B^{[n]}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{pdBf}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{pdBf}_n\\coloneqq\\{(T,F)\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb B^n)\\times\\mathcal P(\\mathbb B^n)\\mid T\\cap F=\\emptyset\\}","display":true},{"tex":"T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n","display":false},{"tex":"T\\cap F=\\emptyset","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{pdBf}_n","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ext}_n(T,F)","display":false}],"bytes":1464,"backlinks":[{"id":"002418bdd321687f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$(T,F)\\in\\mathrm{pdBf}_n$ 见 [[27-df-pdbf]]。"},{"id":"5b4178d75957ed66","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"04f9638612cfbb2f","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$(T,F)\\in\\mathrm{pdBf}_n$ (partial Boolean function, see [[27-df-pdbf]])"},{"id":"162ba4b092f14c5b","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n$，$S\\subseteq[n]$；$\\mathrm{pdBf}_n$ 见 [[27-df-pdbf]]。$a|_S$ 为集合论函数限制。"},{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-300","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-pdbf|df-pdbf — Partially defined Boolean functions]]"},{"id":"b34bdf6ca13d4805","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n$ (partial truth and false sets, see [[27-df-pdbf]])"},{"id":"6164dd467b436ea1","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d5649903f3f896c7","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["1da79f596b2671f9","4b84ee77aaf0c828","2080bf803b294b75"]}